# MOVEMENT I — DEVELOPMENT part a: b101-130
# b101-112 [F]: the CELL migrates UP to the violas (pp), bass silent: a new,
#   hollow colour. T1 head in ob/fl/cl in Eb minor; pivot via the shared
#   diminished 7th (D-F-Ab-Cb = B-D-F-Ab) to G7 -> C minor.
# b113-130 [G]: FUGATO. Subject = T1 head + falling tail + CELL(c) as its
#   last bar (subject and ostinato fuse). Entries vc/cb (C) b113, va (G)
#   b117, vn2 (C) b121, vn1 (G) b125; countersubject = held line
#   (eb | eb f d | c c b | CELL in 10ths). After each entry that voice
#   takes over the ostinato. Intensity 1 -> 4.

